---
import "../../css/styles.css";
import "../../css/accessibility.css";
import "../../css/content-page.css";
import "../../css/motion-narrative.css";
import "../../css/lab.css";
import InnerPageHeader from "../../components/InnerPageHeader.astro";
import MotionNarrative from "../../components/MotionNarrative.astro";
import SeoHead from "../../components/SeoHead.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { latestRelease } from "../../data/release";
const siteRoot = new URL(import.meta.env.SITE);
const siteBase = new URL(import.meta.env.BASE_URL, siteRoot);
const pageUrl = new URL("lab/", siteBase);
const englishUrl = new URL("en/lab/", siteBase);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <SeoHead
      lang="zh-CN"
      pageUrl={pageUrl}
      alternateUrl={englishUrl}
      title="EasyKiConverter · 3D 技术实验室"
      description="独立的 STEP、网格和截面交互实验，不影响官网首页加载。"
    />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <a class="content-page-skip" href="#lab-main">跳转到实验室正文</a>
    <InnerPageHeader lang="zh-CN" pageUrl={pageUrl} alternateUrl={englishUrl} />
    <main id="lab-main">
      <section class="lab-intro" aria-labelledby="lab-title">
        <p class="kicker">按需加载 · 实验性 3D</p>
        <h1 id="lab-title">真实几何，独立实验。</h1>
        <p>查看由真实 STEP 几何生成的 GLB 交付模型，再切换网格星图、剖面断层与拓扑视图。模型就绪后可逐步使用实验控件；首页不加载 CAD/WASM。</p>
        <div class="lab-warning" aria-label="实验室加载说明">
          <div class="lab-warning-heading"><span>加载说明</span><strong>GLB 优先</strong></div>
          <div class="lab-warning-metrics">
            <span><b>10.0 MB</b><small>桌面 GLB</small></span>
            <span><b>8.4 MB</b><small>移动 GLB</small></span>
          </div>
          <p>只有模型加载失败时才回退到 STEP/WASM。适合桌面浏览器与技术验证；下载软件请使用下方稳定版入口，产品信息请返回首页。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="lab-intro-actions">
          <a class="button button-dark" data-release-link href={latestRelease.url} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">查看 {latestRelease.tag} 稳定版下载 <span>↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link text-link-internal" href={siteBase.href}>返回产品首页 <span>→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link text-link-internal" href={new URL("formats/", siteBase).pathname}>查看格式矩阵 <span>→</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <MotionNarrative lang="zh" />
    </main>
    <SiteFooter lang="zh-CN" />
    <script>
      import "../../js/app";
    </script>
    <script>
      import { setupModel } from "../../js/model-viewer";
      setupModel();
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
